<title>GREECE: BANK/GREECE TO DRAIN 150BLN DRS VIA DEPO TENDER.</title>
<headline>BANK/GREECE TO DRAIN 150BLN DRS VIA DEPO TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Greek central bank offered to drain up to 150 billion drachmas of 14-day depos through a competitive interest rate tender today, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
